{"repositoryId":1264367118,"availability":"available","full":"kanylbullen/xupersplit","name":"xupersplit","description":"Accountless group expense splitter — share a link, everyone adds what they paid, settle up with Swish, Lightning or onchain USDC. Also an MCP server: your AI assistant can run a whole split, no account or API key. Next.js + Supabase, MIT. Farcaster Mini App.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-09T20:23:20Z","updated":"2026-10-14T15:58:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://split.xuper.fun","topics":["ai-agents","crypto-payments","expense-splitter","farcaster","lightning-network","mcp","model-context-protocol","nextjs","pwa","react","split-expenses","splitwise-alternative","stablecoins","supabase","swish","tailwindcss","typescript","usdc","web3"],"demo":"https://split.xuper.fun/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:30.868Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:30.868Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:30.868Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T11:32:30.868Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Split shared expenses without the fuss. Create a split, share the link, and let everyone add what they paid — balances and who-owes-whom are worked out automatically, with one-tap payments straight from the balance view.","Next.js 16 · Supabase · Tailwind v4 · wagmi/viem","Create a split and see who owes whom · a Swish QR with the amount already in it · splitting by shares"],"features":["No account needed. The unguessable split link (122 bits of entropy) is","the capability. Sign-in is optional.","Flexible splitting — equal, weighted shares, or exact amounts, with cent","rounding via the largest-remainder method.","Smart settlements — the minimum set of \"A pays B\" transfers, with"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kanylbullen/xupersplit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"95b4f2515a7fdf487856